{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monster Kart</i> is an entertainment-oriented racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After entering the game, press the Space key to start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then use the <strong>\u2190 (Left Arrow)</strong> and <strong>\u2192 (Right Arrow)</strong> keys to select a map, and press either the <strong>Space key\u00a0</strong>or <strong>X key</strong> to confirm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the same method to select a character, and then you can enter the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game, use the <strong>\u2190 (Left Arrow)</strong> and <strong>\u2192 (Right Arrow)</strong> keys on the keyboard to steer, the <strong>\u2191 (Up Arrow)</strong> key to accelerate, the <strong>Z key</strong> to activate skills, and the <strong>X key</strong> to drift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure victory by being the first to cross the finish line through actions such as activating item skills, accelerating, and drifting.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103980?t=1762494308","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103980?t=1762494308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103980/706deb905ef108328de3049a76ff761e2f1a8cf9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762494308","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103980/706deb905ef108328de3049a76ff761e2f1a8cf9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762494308","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monster Kart</i> is an entertainment-oriented racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After entering the game, press the Space key to start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then use the <strong>\u2190 (Left Arrow)</strong> and <strong>\u2192 (Right Arrow)</strong> keys to select a map, and press either the <strong>Space key\u00a0</strong>or <strong>X key</strong> to confirm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the same method to select a character, and then you can enter the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game, use the <strong>\u2190 (Left Arrow)</strong> and <strong>\u2192 (Right Arrow)</strong> keys on the keyboard to steer, the <strong>\u2191 (Up Arrow)</strong> key to accelerate, the <strong>Z key</strong> to activate skills, and the <strong>X key</strong> to drift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure victory by being the first to cross the finish line through actions such as activating item skills, accelerating, and drifting.</p>","developers":["yu"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103980/4a23e53c1efa6a99fb1883d09cf630b8673e3cc9/header.jpg?t=1762494308","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4103980/618363743/5ef518b723f2ed27ec287761057f822558667897/1760182161/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761016482","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4103980/618363743/5ef518b723f2ed27ec287761057f822558667897/1760182161/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761016482","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4103980/618363743/5ef518b723f2ed27ec287761057f822558667897/1760182161/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761016482","id":257216026,"name":"\u8d85\u7ea7\u5361\u4e01 Monster Kart","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216026/8494d84